 &gt;
 Description of sw_usage_0/1
 &lt;/h2&gt;
 &lt;a data-clipboard-text="https://openbouffalo.github.io/chips/bl808/efuse/#description-of-sw_usage_01" class="gdoc-page__anchor clip flex align-center" title="Anchor to: Description of sw_usage_0/1" aria-label="Anchor to: Description of sw_usage_0/1" href="#description-of-sw_usage_01"&gt;
